.SH NAME
qxctl-spreader-deploy - Push the compiled Spreader to the Execution Node stub cleanly executing Checksums


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBqxctl spreader deploy [binary_name] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Push the compiled Spreader to the Execution Node stub cleanly executing Checksums


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for deploy


